    "description": "Have fun ~ Over 2,300 cartoons and online novels are waiting for you!\r\nBut ... why comico?\r\n\r\n\r\n\"Quality content\"\r\nIntense story Unbeatable fun Line art Good job guaranteed with over 34 million downloads worldwide!\r\n\r\n\"Enormous category\"\r\nAny love, especially the Y! Fantasy line!\r\n\r\n\"Always fresh.\"\r\nUpdated new episodes everyday New stories released every week\r\n\r\n\"Rich in authentic\"\r\nCartoons translated from genuine copyright directly from Japan, Korea, Taiwan, China and Thailand.\r\n\r\n\"It's free.\"\r\nThere are many free cartoons. Give away free Reward Coin every day! Also have fun activities Many cool promotions!\r\n\r\n\r\nOh ~ The function is equally advanced!\r\n\u2605 Recommend comics according to your own reading style!\r\n\u2605 Offline download. Enjoy anywhere, anytime. Don't reconcile the internet\r\n\u2605 filters are easy to find Will get to have fun together faster!\r\n\u2605 can be read whenever there is a friend in every scene At the southern comment section\r\n\u2605 Click to follow. Updates when new episodes Notify immediately!\r\n\u2605 Reading history Please remember the last chapter you read. Continue playing!\r\n\u2605 Fret not afraid, get stumbled, get back the Reward Coin with the button for \"Rent / Buy All\"\r\n\r\n\r\nFollow news Talk more here.\r\nFacebook: comico Thailand\r\nYoutube: comico Thailand\r\nTwitter: @comicoTH\r\nInstagram: comico_th\r\nWebsite: www.comico.in.th",
